        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Stand (miniseries)\n- People: Stephen King, Gary Sinise, Warren Frost\n- Topics: Awards, television miniseries, TV movies\n\nFacts:\n- Stephen King wrote the novel The Stand, which was adapted into the 1994 American television miniseries The Stand.\n- The Stand is a 1994 American television miniseries based on Stephen King's novel of the same name.\n- Warren Frost appeared in the TV movie The Stand in 1994.\n- Gary Sinise has won an Emmy Award, a Golden Globe Award, and a star on the Hollywood Walk of Fame, and he has also been nominated for an Academy Award.",
